            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **Two sessions from different tools could be treated as one.** When their ids
  happened to match, one could disappear from the fleet or show the other's
  project, model or folder — and clicking its approval could open the wrong one.
  Perch now tells sessions apart by tool as well as id.
]]></description>
